    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cryptic note from your recently deceased father, and his strange old book, you embark on a journey that  questions reality. Travelling through dimensions and spaces, where humans were never meant to go, and encountering the things that dwell at the edge of our dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of Eldritch knowledge, Non-Euclidean realms and understanding beyond reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the book of arcane lore, with all the instructions you need to unlock reality and commune with the true powers of the universe. What will you do with it? Did it have something to do with your father's disappearance? Will it give you the ability to bring him back? Is the knowledge of gods, older than time, yours for the taking?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw the circles of power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy the strange and mysterious symbols and patterns from the book into the world.\u00a0 Use them to help you on the path to saving your father. Unlock their hidden meanings and discover their true powers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/ef0bb1ac737ad97c0db6c8c16f919f2d.poster.avif?t=1734298459\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/ef0bb1ac737ad97c0db6c8c16f919f2d.webm?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/ef0bb1ac737ad97c0db6c8c16f919f2d.mp4?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chant the sacred words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak the holy words as written in the book. Uncover the secret to their formula and even greater understanding is yours to unlock\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/38d0568b9cd31e260342a14ce334bddf.poster.avif?t=1734298459\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/38d0568b9cd31e260342a14ce334bddf.webm?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/38d0568b9cd31e260342a14ce334bddf.mp4?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perform the rites of ancient gods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform the secret hand gestures, scribe the true names of the gods and conduct rituals and ceremonies that even the gods will hear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a cryptic note from your recently deceased father, and his strange old book, you embark on a journey that  questions reality. Travelling through dimensions and spaces, where humans were never meant to go, and encountering the things that dwell at the edge of our dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game of Eldritch knowledge, Non-Euclidean realms and understanding beyond reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the book of arcane lore, with all the instructions you need to unlock reality and commune with the true powers of the universe. What will you do with it? Did it have something to do with your father's disappearance? Will it give you the ability to bring him back? Is the knowledge of gods, older than time, yours for the taking?\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Draw the circles of power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy the strange and mysterious symbols and patterns from the book into the world.\u00a0 Use them to help you on the path to saving your father. Unlock their hidden meanings and discover their true powers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/ef0bb1ac737ad97c0db6c8c16f919f2d.poster.avif?t=1734298459\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/ef0bb1ac737ad97c0db6c8c16f919f2d.webm?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/ef0bb1ac737ad97c0db6c8c16f919f2d.mp4?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chant the sacred words</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak the holy words as written in the book. Uncover the secret to their formula and even greater understanding is yours to unlock\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/38d0568b9cd31e260342a14ce334bddf.poster.avif?t=1734298459\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/38d0568b9cd31e260342a14ce334bddf.webm?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325640/extras/38d0568b9cd31e260342a14ce334bddf.mp4?t=1734298459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perform the rites of ancient gods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform the secret hand gestures, scribe the true names of the gods and conduct rituals and ceremonies that even the gods will hear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
